# --- Life tab integrations (260607-h2k) ---
#
# Dependency picks (see plan D-01..D-10):
#   - react-github-calendar  (wraps react-activity-calendar; jogruber public proxy)
#     docs: https://github.com/grubersjoe/react-github-calendar
#   - ccusage v20 (CLI subprocess — v20 dropped the library API; we shell to
#     `ccusage daily --json` from the integration. The plan's library-import
#     path is unavailable on v20+; documented as a deviation in SUMMARY.)
#     docs: https://ccusage.com
#   - strava-v3 (OAuth refresh helper, no auto-persist)
#     docs: https://github.com/UnbounDev/node-strava-v3
#
# GitHub: NO TOKEN NEEDED. react-github-calendar fetches from the public
# jogruber proxy (github-contributions-api.jogruber.de). Single-user app —
# rate limit (12 req/min for no-cache) is irrelevant. If outages ever rise,
# we can fall back to GraphQL + PAT via the library's transformData prop.

# Strava activity panel
# 1. Register an app at https://www.strava.com/settings/api
# 2. Copy client_id + client_secret here
# 3. Run: node tools/strava-mint.mjs  (writes refresh_token to Supabase integration_tokens)
# Note: STRAVA_REFRESH_TOKEN is NOT in env — Strava rotates it on every exchange,
# so it lives in Supabase integration_tokens table.
STRAVA_CLIENT_ID=
STRAVA_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Claude Code (ccusage): no env var — CLI reads ~/.claude/projects/ directly
# Flow Pomodoro: no env var — reads ~/Desktop/Flow-Stats.csv directly
# (Optional override: FLOW_STATS_PATH=/custom/path/Flow-Stats.csv)
